{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_statchain", "label": "statchain.jsonl \u2014 the second, stationary chain", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The sealed nlchain.jsonl remains the ruling chain until the comparison is scored; the score is the ORDERING (entrant, rank 1, rank 2), not the energy, and ~0.03 mHa energy moves are expected and are not findings.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_stat84", "label": "pack83/stat84.py (the chain driver)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_cost_projection", "label": "Projected 8-12x cost: 24-36 hours over 107 rows", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The sealed chain took 10,887 s (median 96 s, max 288 s at Z=89) and s82 measured 12 restart passes for one configuration at Z=89. This does not fit one session and is not to be attempted in one.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_two_floors", "label": "R81.3 \u2014 the two floors, scheme-wide and per-configuration", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Both are computed in the same pass on identical rows and the selection is made from the data after both are in, so the floor choice cannot pre-select the answer.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_doubt_unexercised", "label": "DOUBT-UNEXERCISED stamp on the driver", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The doubted region is the high-Z open-shell 5f/6d rows, where the restart offset was measured with both signs and 12 passes did not exhaust the ESTAT test \u2014 the doubt is that stationarity is DECLARED there rather than REACHED. The control cannot be run in-session, so under R82.2 clause 4 the impossibility is declared and the driver stamped until it runs.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_resume_exactness", "label": "C9 / F53.3 \u2014 resume is byte-exact", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_confirms_nothing_new", "label": "A confirmed chain advances the L\u00f6wdin solution by no step", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "If every entrant holds, R81.1's re-run costs 30 hours to learn nothing new \u2014 which is the correct outcome and must not be dressed up as one. It only makes the existing 107 rows honest.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_stat84", "target": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_statchain", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S84-ITEM2-STATIONARY-CHAIN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s84_item2_stationary_chain_statchain", "target": "recovered_prediction_s81_item2_tol_stationary_to_statio